    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35288" root="قدر" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُدَارٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدْرٌ</span>, last signification. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>A cook:</i>
or <i>one who slaughters camels</i> or <i>other animals;</i>
(S, K;) as being likened to a cook: (TA:) or
<i>one who slaughters camels, and cooks their flesh:</i>
(TA:) and <i>one who cooks in a cooking-pot</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِدْر</span>);
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقْتَدِرٌ</span></b> . (K.)

